## 2. API Endpoint → Data Map

> Every piece of data shown maps to one of these. No fabrication, no endpoints that don't exist.

### 2.1 TRPC Endpoints (via `trpc.*`)

| Endpoint | Call | Returns |
|---|---|---|
| **CFSR Score** | `trpc.risk.getCfsr.useQuery()` | `{ cfsr, riskBand, components: {n1ImportDependency, n2SupplyChainHealth, n3FertilizerAvailability, n4GeopoliticalRisk, n5PriceVolatility}, componentMeta, scoreConfidence, scoreCoverage, delta, computedAt, dataSourcesSummary }` |
| **CFSR History** | `trpc.risk.getCfsrHistory.useQuery({ days: 30 })` | `{ data: [{cfsr, riskBand, computedAt}], _meta }` |
| **Fuzzy State** | `trpc.risk.getFuzzyState.useQuery()` | `{ fertilizer, priceTrend, newsVolume, compound, membershipScores, conflicts, computedAt }` |
| **Dashboard Indices** | `trpc.risk.getDashboardIndices.useQuery()` | `{ data: { retailPriceStress, statePriceDispersion, inputCostStress, globalCommodityStress, newsAttention, dataQuality } }` — each has `{ score, coverage, status, source }` |
| **Current Prices** | `trpc.prices.getCurrent.useQuery({ item?: "rice" })` | `{ data: [...priceRows], _meta }` — rows have `commodityName, priceMyr, priceUsd, date, state, unit, seriesType` etc. |
| **Price Trend** | `trpc.prices.getTrend.useQuery({ item: "rice", days: 30 })` | `{ data: [{date, price}], trendPct, _meta }` |
| **News** | `trpc.news.getLatest.useQuery({ limit: 20 })` | `{ data: [{title, url, source, publishedAt, sentimentScore, insightScore, severity, isAlert, primaryCommodity, implication, sentimentSide}], _meta }` |
| **AI Analysis** | `trpc.ai.getAnalysis.useQuery({ type: "cfsr_analysis" })` | `{ content, structuredOutput, generatedAt, dataContext }` — types: `cfsr_analysis`, `recommendations`, `gap_analysis` |
| **Live Data Status** | `trpc.liveData.getStatus.useQuery()` | `{ lastRuns: [{job, success, startedAt, durationMs, rowsWritten, error}], allRecentLogs }` |

### 2.2 Hono REST Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Returns |
|---|---|---|
| `/api/status` | GET | Job definitions + last run per job |
| `/api/provenance` | GET | `{ computedAt, dataSources: string[] }` |
| `/api/health` | GET | `{ status: "ok", time }` |

